  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "거기, 너!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC70AE30002C0020B1080021001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잠깐 괜찮을까?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7A0AE500020AD1CCC2EC744AE4C003F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "전에는 미끄메라의 주인으로\n의심해서 미안했어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C804C5D0B2940020BBF8B044BA54B77CC7580020C8FCC778C73CB85C000AC758C2ECD574C11C0020BBF8C548D588C5B4002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서 사과하려고\n멈춰 세운 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C0020C0ACACFCD558B824ACE0000ABA48CDB00020C138C6B40020AC70C57C002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼 이만, 미르 미술관 강도 사건 때문에\n바빠서 말이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC0020C774B9CC002C0020BBF8B9740020BBF8C220AD000020AC15B3C40020C0ACAC740020B54CBB38C5D0000ABC14BE60C11C0020B9D0C774C57C002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "큰 사건 같네요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D0700020C0ACAC740020AC19B124C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "도와드릴까요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C4C640B4DCB9B4AE4CC694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오해하게 해서 미안.\n방금 말한 건 그냥 훈련 이름이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624D574D558AC8C0020D574C11C0020BBF8C548002E000ABC29AE080020B9D0D55C0020AC740020ADF8B0E50020D6C8B8280020C774B984C774C57C002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르 경찰들은 정기적으로 훈련을 하는데,\n이번에는 미술관이 타깃이라는 설정이거든.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B9740020ACBDCC30B4E4C7400020C815AE30C801C73CB85C0020D6C8B828C7440020D558B294B370002C000AC774BC88C5D0B2940020BBF8C220AD00C7740020D0C0AE43C774B77CB2940020C124C815C774AC70B4E0002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잠깐...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7A0AE50002E002E002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네가 도와줄 일이 있을 것 같아!\n너의 실력은 내가 이미 잘 알고 있으니까.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124AC000020B3C4C640C9040020C77CC7740020C788C7440020AC830020AC19C5440021000AB108C7580020C2E4B825C7400020B0B4AC000020C774BBF80020C7980020C54CACE00020C788C73CB2C8AE4C002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "강도 역할을 맡아서\n미르 미술관을 습격하는 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC15B3C40020C5EDD560C7440020B9E1C544C11C000ABBF8B9740020BBF8C220AD00C7440020C2B5ACA9D558B2940020AC70C57C0021001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준비가 되면 나한테 말해 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900BE44AC000020B418BA740020B098D55CD14C0020B9D0D5740020C918002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "강도가 될... 이게 아니라,\n강도 역할을 맡을 준비는 됐니?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC15B3C4AC000020B420002E002E002E0020C774AC8C0020C544B2C8B77C002C000AAC15B3C40020C5EDD560C7440020B9E1C7440020C900BE44B2940020B410B2C8003F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준비됐어요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900BE44B410C5B4C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이번 훈련은\n네가 얼마나 진지하게 임하느냐에 달렸어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774BC880020D6C8B828C740000AB124AC000020C5BCB9C8B0980020C9C4C9C0D558AC8C0020C784D558B290B0D0C5D00020B2ECB838C5B4002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 훈련을 시작하자!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020D6C8B828C7440020C2DCC791D558C7900021001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너의 역할은\n입구를 통해 미술관에 진입해서<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n2층에 전시된\n고대 신오인의 옷을 훔치는 거야.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n도중에 경찰관들이 너를 포박하려고\n승부를 걸면 상대해 주면 돼.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르 경찰서에서 엄선한 경찰관들이니까\n마음 단단히 먹는 게 좋을걸.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B9740020ACBDCC30C11CC5D0C11C0020C5C4C120D55C0020ACBDCC30AD00B4E4C774B2C8AE4C000AB9C8C74C0020B2E8B2E8D7880020BA39B2940020AC8C0020C88BC744AC78002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "옥상에서 뛰어내리는 게 시작 신호니까\n준비되면 부탁할게.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C625C0C1C5D0C11C0020B6F0C5B4B0B4B9ACB2940020AC8C0020C2DCC7910020C2E0D638B2C8AE4C000AC900BE44B418BA740020BD80D0C1D560AC8C002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "훈련 루트를 잊어버린 거야?\n정면 입구를 통해 미술관에 진입해 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D6C8B8280020B8E8D2B8B97C0020C78AC5B4BC84B9B00020AC70C57C003F000AC815BA740020C785AD6CB97C0020D1B5D5740020BBF8C220AD00C5D00020C9C4C785D5740020C918002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "멈춰라!\n멈추지 않으면 포켓몬을 꺼내겠다!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n...이렇게 하면 되는 거지?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA48CDB0B77C0021000ABA48CD94C9C00020C54AC73CBA740020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020AEBCB0B4ACA0B2E4002100100001BE00000A002E002E002EC774B807AC8C0020D558BA740020B418B2940020AC70C9C0003F00100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이번 훈련은 실패인걸!\n처음부터 다시 시작해 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774BC880020D6C8B828C7400020C2E4D328C778AC780021000ACC98C74CBD80D1300020B2E4C2DC0020C2DCC791D5740020C918002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "정문을 돌파당했다!\n강도가 안으로 진입하고 있다!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n...이렇게 하면 되는 거지?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C815BB38C7440020B3CCD30CB2F9D588B2E40021000AAC15B3C4AC000020C548C73CB85C0020C9C4C785D558ACE00020C788B2E4002100100001BE00000A002E002E002EC774B807AC8C0020D558BA740020B418B2940020AC70C9C0003F00100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "꺄아~!\n강도가 나타났다~!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE84C544007E0021000AAC15B3C4AC000020B098D0C0B0ACB2E4007E002100100002011400230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "2층에 전시된\n고대 신오인의 옷을 훔쳐 갈 거예요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0032CE35C5D00020C804C2DCB41C000AACE0B3000020C2E0C624C778C7580020C637C7440020D6D4CCD00020AC080020AC70C608C694002100100002011400230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "꺄아~!\n강도가 나타났다~!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE84C544007E0021000AAC15B3C4AC000020B098D0C0B0ACB2E4007E002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이대로 있다간 2층에 있는\n고대 신오인의 옷이!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B300B85C0020C788B2E4AC0400200032CE35C5D00020C788B294000AACE0B3000020C2E0C624C778C7580020C637C774002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "위법 행위를 멈추십시오!\n정문을 돌파한 당신을 체포하겠습니다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C704BC950020D589C704B97C0020BA48CD94C2EDC2DCC6240021000AC815BB38C7440020B3CCD30CD55C0020B2F9C2E0C7440020CCB4D3ECD558ACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002100100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿%",
