      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "정문에 이어서\n접수 데스크도 뚫렸습니다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C815BB38C5D00020C774C5B4C11C000AC811C2180020B370C2A4D06CB3C40020B6ABB838C2B5B2C8B2E4002100100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "훈련이긴 하지만\n진 것 때문에 혼나겠네요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D6C8B828C774AE340020D558C9C0B9CC000AC9C40020AC830020B54CBB38C5D00020D63CB098ACA0B124C694002E002E002E00100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿(",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "거기까지다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC70AE30AE4CC9C0B2E4002100100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이렇게 된 이상 훈련이 아니라\n실전처럼 상대해 주마!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B807AC8C0020B41C0020C774C0C10020D6C8B828C7740020C544B2C8B77C000AC2E4C804CC98B7FC0020C0C1B300D5740020C8FCB9C8002100100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿+",
